        "3.\n",
        "Without a pipeline, fitting StandardScaler or OneHotEncoder on the entire dataset before splitting into train. That lets information from the test set leak into training. By wrapping everything in a Pipeline, only on X_train ensures the scaler and encoder learn their parameters only from training data. ColumnTransformer on top of that lets you apply different transformations like scaling vs. encoding to different column types in one step, so you don't have to manually track and reapply transformations separately."
